        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nRAY COOKE Lettings are delighted to present this fantastic 1 bed / 1 bath apartment to the letting market in Coultry Forum Centre, Santry, Dublin 9.\nIdeally located in the heart of Santry, this property is surrounded by a fantastic range of local amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants and the Omni Shopping Centre. Dublin Airport is also just a short drive away, while the M50, Dublin City Centre and a host of bus routes are all easily accessible.\nThe accommodation comprises of a welcoming entrance hallway, bright and spacious open-plan living/dining area with fully fitted kitchen, generous double bedroom and main bathroom.\nThe apartment is presented in good condition throughout and offers comfortable and well-proportioned living accommodation in a highly convenient location.\nThis property is sure to appeal to a wide range of tenants and viewing is highly advised. Contact RAY COOKE Lettings today to arrange a viewing.\n\nAdditional Features;\n- 1 bed / 1 bath\n- Apartment\n- Fantastic condition throughout\n- Comes fully furnished\n- Top quality windows & doors\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings\n- Top quality flooring\n- Very spacious rooms\n- Top quality blinds\n- Fully fitted kitchen\n- Integrated appliances\n- Peaceful location\n- Located in the heart of Santry\n- All local amenities within a short stroll\n- Ideal for a wide range of tenants\n- Viewing highly advised\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
